/// 🧪️ Real LEB128-varint-length-prefixed binary primitives (`store::pack_rt::write_varint_u64` /
/// `store::ByteReader`, same helpers `stdio.json`'s upgraded `OpBinary`/`DiffCodec` reuse) backing
